		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://localhost:8080/?p=172</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This is fixture post number 17 with status draft.</p><img src="http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fixture-photo-17-300x200.jpg" srcset="http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fixture-photo-17.jpg" class="wp-image-20" alt="fixture" /><p>Some fixture body copy to give the importer real paragraph content to carry over, covering post 17 of 250.</p><img src="http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fixture-photo-92-300x200.jpg" srcset="http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fixture-photo-92.jpg" class="wp-image-95" alt="fixture" />]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Excerpt for fixture post 17.]]></excerpt:encoded>
		<wp:post_id>172</wp:post_id>
		<wp:post_date><![CDATA[2026-08-26 22:49:14]]></wp:post_date>
		<wp:post_date_gmt><![CDATA[0000-00-00 00:00:00]]></wp:post_date_gmt>
		<wp:post_modified><![CDATA[2026-08-26 22:49:14]]></wp:post_modified>
		<wp:post_modified_gmt><![CDATA[0000-00-00 00:00:00]]></wp:post_modified_gmt>
		<wp:comment_status><![CDATA[open]]></wp:comment_status>
		<wp:ping_status><![CDATA[open]]></wp:ping_status>
		<wp:post_name><![CDATA[]]></wp:post_name>
		<wp:status><![CDATA[draft]]></wp:status>
		<wp:post_parent>0</wp:post_parent>
		<wp:menu_order>0</wp:menu_order>
		<wp:post_type><![CDATA[post]]></wp:post_type>
		<wp:post_password><![CDATA[]]></wp:post_password>
		<wp:is_sticky>0</wp:is_sticky>
										<category domain="post_tag" nicename="community"><![CDATA[community]]></category>
		<category domain="post_tag" nicename="feedback"><![CDATA[feedback]]></category>
